OL,3,ARussian strikes cut power to thousands
OL,4,Ain Ukraine as Kherson ceasefire ends
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rare humanitarian ceasefire in
OL,7,FUkraine's front-line Kherson region
OL,8,Fthat allowed civilians to evacuate the
OL,9,FRussian-occupied city of Oleshky has
OL,10,Fended.
OL,12,FThe localised ceasefire was due to end
OL,13,Fat 22:59 Ukrainian time (21:00 GMT) on
OL,14,FSunday. While the truce had held since
OL,15,Fit was implemented last week, fighting
OL,16,Fhad continued elsewhere.
OL,18,FOn Sunday evening, Ukraine's air alert
OL,19,Fsystem was apparently hacked, the
OL,20,Fcountry's air force said, warning of
OL,21,Fradiation over Kyiv - a reference to a
OL,22,Fpossible nuclear attack.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
