OL,3,AIsraeli strikes in Gaza kill eight
OL,4,Aincluding child, hospitals say
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsraeli strikes in Gaza have killed at
OL,7,Fleast eight people, including a child,
OL,8,Faccording to hospitals, despite a
OL,9,Fyear-old ceasefire.
OL,11,FIn Gaza City to the north, hospital
OL,12,Fofficials said a missile attack hit a
OL,13,Fgroup of civilians next to Cairo School
OL,14,Fin the Al-Rimal neighbourhood, killing
OL,15,Fthree people, including a four-year-old
OL,16,Fboy.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
